title: The Well of Ink
portrait left: seeker

A well in the middle of the reading room, full to the brim with black ink. It does not reflect you.
Something in it is turning, slowly.

choice:
  - Dip a card in (transform one card) -> transform
  - Drink (+6 max HP, and a Debt) -> drink
  - Back away -> leave

@transform
  > card transform choose 1
  The card comes out different. The ink does not come off your hand.
  > end

@drink
  > maxhp 6
  > curse debt
  It tastes like copper and old paper. You feel stronger. You feel owed.
  > end

@leave
  The turning stops as you step back. It starts again when you turn around.
  > end
